### Available LLM models (fills the model picker)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-models
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Realtime engine models — what the agent's model picker shows once an engine is chosen.
### Filter the answer by `provider` (gemini-live, openai-realtime, ...).
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-models?kind=LLM&mode=REALTIME
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Recognition models for the agent sttModel picker
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-models?kind=STT
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Synthesis models for the agent ttsModel picker
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ai-models?kind=TTS
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get AI Model Settings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/ai-model
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update AI Model Settings
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/ai-model
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash",
  "temperature": 0.7,
  "maxOutputTokens": 1024,
  "maxCallSeconds": 300,
  "maxTokensPerCall": 10000
}
